Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:40.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:55.86,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣和你相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.17,0:01:01.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,並不是只為了生存下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:07.89,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,小小的誓言超越時空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.25,0:01:12.89,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,必定會改變未來的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.46,0:01:16.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,LIMITER　（changing myself）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.34,0:01:19.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,釋放出來　（changing youself）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.65,0:01:25.40,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,迸發吧　天使的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.81,0:01:29.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救世界　「翼」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.37,0:01:32.24,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在選擇的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.43,0:01:38.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要抓住夢幻（停不下來）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.74,0:01:41.54,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,被賦予的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.54,0:01:44.19,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,向著天空迫近
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.19,0:01:49.94,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:55.81,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐　my wings
Comment: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.52,0:22:26.24,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要悄悄拭去你溢出的淚水
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.24,0:22:29.19,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,背負著相似命運的小小的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.19,0:22:31.55,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,後背
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.55,0:22:35.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使嚴酷的現實包圍著你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.78,0:22:41.68,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,也絕不會讓你孤身一人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.98,0:22:46.94,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,在骯髒的城市盛開的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.94,0:22:50.48,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,出淤泥而不染的花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.48,0:22:55.74,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是絕對不會讓你哭泣的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:23:00.95,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開那扇門我們就能在一起了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.95,0:23:05.30,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,只有在那個時候訂下的約定
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.30,0:23:10.93,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,一直在我內心深處發光
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.93,0:23:15.63,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法再傷害心靈了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.63,0:23:22.01,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是說漂亮話　罪過也會一併承受
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.01,0:23:24.97,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,和我一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.19,0:23:30.91,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}引起奇蹟　Break Your Destiny
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,TEXT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.91,0:00:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是皆本先生  居然連高LV超能力者的管理官也…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.33,0:00:09.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  她在做什麼夢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  完全無法讀取
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算做什麼  快點將我從這裡放出去  不然…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.35,0:00:22.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很過分嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這…！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王是屬於我的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.53,0:00:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會讓任何人妨礙我的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:31.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介  你究竟想做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:07.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(730,570)\fad(500,500)}39th  sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:07.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(780,600)\fad(500,500)}「夢幻泡影！精神駭客」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.87,0:02:11.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離開B.A.B.E.L到我身邊來  女王
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.63,0:02:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:17.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論是在夢境中還是在現實中  出口都只有這一個
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.79,0:02:25.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你會在這裡  桐壺君
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.54,0:02:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這臭老頭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.90,0:02:29.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵？！  紫穗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.22,0:02:32.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部少佐  你果然是個大意不得的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.43,0:02:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然用皆本君做人質來拉攏薰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是饒不了你這個卑鄙小人的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.34,0:02:54.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是惹惱我了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們在做什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:02:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是恐怖分子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.05,0:03:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 滾開  不要礙事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.91,0:03:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,限制器  解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.70,0:03:08.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王  這件事就留到下次再說
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.15,0:03:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別小看我們
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.37,0:03:11.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會讓你逃走的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:15.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真行啊  不愧是光速女神
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:15.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs24\pos(742,660)}Light Speed Goddess
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.87,0:03:17.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在囉嗦些什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:23.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做…做過頭了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.03,0:03:25.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也來幫忙  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.43,0:03:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可不是會被這點攻擊打垮的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.57,0:03:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說的沒錯  女神
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.15,0:03:34.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小葵？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:36.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混帳！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.69,0:03:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會成為你的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.57,0:03:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你敢對皆本和葵他們出手的話——！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:44.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.94,0:03:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我疏忽了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.34,0:03:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來我是操之過急了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.91,0:03:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.44,0:03:54.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作為惹你生氣的歉禮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.36,0:03:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個給你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:57.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照片？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.09,0:04:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說不定能進入到他的夢中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.75,0:04:03.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點長大吧  女王
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:06.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓他逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是我  說不定能進入到皆本的夢中？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.17,0:04:17.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  這是？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:20.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰 小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.10,0:04:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.67,0:04:45.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.15,0:04:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.38,0:04:49.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等很久了嗎  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.05,0:04:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  身體不舒服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:57.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是感冒了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.16,0:05:02.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點回去暖暖身子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.51,0:05:12.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  要用手做  用手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  現在手沒空嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.72,0:05:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太會撒嬌了  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.99,0:05:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已經不是小孩子了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.93,0:05:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太會撒嬌了  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.31,0:05:29.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已經不是小孩子了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.16,0:05:30.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊  喂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你究竟怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.57,0:05:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我全都知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.84,0:05:36.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭馬上就要開始了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:37.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是這種事情…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.77,0:05:43.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你非要去的話  我會將你…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.01,0:05:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.67,0:05:50.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要動
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:57.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要動  破壞女王
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:57.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs24\pos(698,660)}Queen of Catastrophy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.74,0:05:58.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…薰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.32,0:06:01.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼皆本要對我…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.48,0:06:12.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  即使我不在了也不會有任何改變
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.84,0:06:15.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他大量的超能力者們是不會停止戰鬥的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.90,0:06:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼你就去制止大家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:20.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了  無論是超能力者還是普通人…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.30,0:06:22.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種戰鬥能帶來什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:25.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經辦不到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道嗎  皆本  我啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.69,0:06:31.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  聽得到嗎  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.87,0:06:32.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:33.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能被程序所影響
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.23,0:06:35.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是夢境  你明白了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.24,0:06:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.52,0:06:41.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夢境？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.70,0:06:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有反應了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我想的一樣   小薰受到的催眠程度比較淺
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.16,0:06:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果和皆本的精神同步的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.73,0:06:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就可能將他們一起從夢境中帶出來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:57.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論如何都要找到出口
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.40,0:06:58.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能做到嗎  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.67,0:07:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聲音太大了  把音量調小點
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:02.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是出口在哪啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.05,0:07:04.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個我們會調查的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:05.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:06.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.95,0:07:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖到我這邊來  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:11.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本還是處於夢境之中啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.19,0:07:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過…  那就由我來讓你清醒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:20.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我上了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:23.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  住手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.06,0:07:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們快逃  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.20,0:07:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噩夢已經結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.26,0:07:32.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊  這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:41.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  從那裡出去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.59,0:07:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:43.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不一定是出口
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們或許會被夢的程序排出  陷入更深層的昏睡狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.58,0:07:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我們沒有其它選擇了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:57.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花式游泳？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:08:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對  非要說的話那也是花式睡眠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小葵  紫穗  準備出動
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.28,0:08:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}Doubt{\r}\N懷疑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.33,0:08:16.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:17.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你為什麼會知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.83,0:08:20.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是弱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.53,0:08:21.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:22.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲  大總統
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:24.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身體狀況如何
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是上次的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.23,0:08:29.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊呀  硬實的背肌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.46,0:08:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鍛鍊了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.91,0:08:35.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看了哦  秘密的個人情報文件
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:37.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,見不得人的數據多如牛毛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.55,0:08:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:41.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想被曝光的話  對了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.69,0:08:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先把貴國秘密抓獲的高LV超能力者的名單交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:49.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這怎麼可以  我拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要會錯意了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.27,0:08:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是交易  是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.41,0:09:02.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們終於要正式向世界邁步了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.25,0:09:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過你這是怎麼了啊  少佐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.13,0:09:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然間這麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.05,0:09:09.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼  你們也覺得日本已經不夠鬧了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:15.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且她作為女王君臨的那一天遲早會來的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.87,0:09:18.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須在現在做好力所能及的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.62,0:09:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此  確實是令人感興趣之事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.80,0:09:24.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解除了巴雷特的洗腦的那個力量
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:28.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確實和普通的高LV超能力者有著明顯的區別
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.91,0:09:29.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.63,0:09:32.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道是黑色幽靈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.09,0:09:41.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然我還不了解女王代表什麼意義
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.85,0:09:43.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我會向我主人報告的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多保重了  P.A.N.D.R.A的諸位
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.65,0:09:52.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那女孩子是什麼人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:58.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這裡沒錯吧  The Hound
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.47,0:10:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  裡面大概只有黑卷一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.32,0:10:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好  初音
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.06,0:10:04.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給你獎勵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音說的沒錯  附近沒有像是P.A.N.D.R.A的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.71,0:10:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過她住的地方真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.41,0:10:14.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,資金豐富啊  也就是說…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.99,0:10:18.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟著P.A.N.D.R.A待遇比較好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:22.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  這不是需要深思的事情吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.15,0:10:26.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切  偏偏在少佐他們不在的時候…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:30.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了  稍微反擊下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.55,0:10:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}な…中村悠一{\r}\N中…中村悠一
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}ちょっとマニア{\r}\N有點狂熱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.39,0:10:47.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  首先必須要以逮捕黑卷為優先事項
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.05,0:10:50.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題  你們做得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.67,0:10:52.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼The Children…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.23,0:10:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,& Wild Cat
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:56.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使赴湯蹈火
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算無法進入夢境
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.97,0:11:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了同伴也要勇往直前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children & Wild Cat
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.58,0:11:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小的們  給我跟上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:13.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.13,0:11:16.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊有很多地雷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.83,0:11:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突入應該先讓葵姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經晚了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.09,0:11:21.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太晚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.27,0:11:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們就在那裡保持不動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.01,0:11:25.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會馬上把黑卷抓住的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:31.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來她很慌張啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始鎮壓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.28,0:11:40.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}Psychic Stan Subjection{\r}\N念動失神制壓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.80,0:11:43.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  鏡子？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.39,0:11:50.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先將一位客人帶到噩夢中去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:50.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直美小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:51.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:11:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個房間是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.22,0:12:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接著是將兩位客人帶過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.07,0:12:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵？  紫穗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.77,0:12:20.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  來整理一下情況吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:24.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們現在因為黑卷節子的能力而做著同一個夢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.72,0:12:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,契機是意念投影製作的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:31.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有我們知道那上面是某位特定的女性
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:33.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以做了相同的夢…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.80,0:12:34.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.72,0:12:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才那是…  莫非是未來真的會發生的事情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:41.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.36,0:12:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我從剛才就把那當成是單純的夢境…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:51.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是內心卻是忐忑不安
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.78,0:12:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本你知道些什麼吧  吶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:12:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷靜點  這只是一場夢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:01.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能上兵部的當
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.48,0:13:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.53,0:13:08.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我相信你們  你們不是The Children嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:10.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以絕對不會輸的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.53,0:13:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.31,0:13:17.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精神攻擊很難對高LV超能力者奏效的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.84,0:13:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更何況我和你同樣是精神感應系的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.72,0:13:24.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我就再讓你陷入最深度睡眠中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:28.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能  不能看那個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.61,0:13:30.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會被她的睡眠影像抓住的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:37.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼小鬼會有槍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:39.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是小孩子用的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.57,0:13:42.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且不要閉著眼睛開槍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:44.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是接觸感應能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.81,0:13:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算不看也知道子彈會射向哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.77,0:13:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.91,0:13:49.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.19,0:13:55.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.76,0:13:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自爆裝置？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.45,0:14:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無法解除
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小葵  快起來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.69,0:14:10.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小葵這裡很敏感吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.95,0:14:16.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要弄我耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.41,0:14:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鹿  趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.67,0:14:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了  局長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.55,0:14:25.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑卷！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.29,0:14:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真遺憾啊  笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.48,0:14:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經可以動了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:39.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地雷全部移動掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.41,0:14:39.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.85,0:14:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直美
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.24,0:14:48.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把救出皆本先生他們的方法  以及P.A.N.D.R.A的組織全貌
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:50.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部招出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.65,0:14:54.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒用的  你無法從我這得到任何情報
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:55.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.71,0:14:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然對自己使用能力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.60,0:15:01.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經吃不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.13,0:15:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她躲到防壁裡去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.62,0:15:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非她自己醒來  不然就無法得到任何情報了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.85,0:15:12.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄她的耳垂如何
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.99,0:15:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你才會那麼敏感的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.70,0:15:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面已經過多久了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.07,0:15:21.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須靠自己想辦法出去…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.35,0:15:25.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我無所謂  維持這樣也沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.58,0:15:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下  這或許就是我們無法離開這裡的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.58,0:15:32.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的精神波比我或黑卷要強的多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在的我是大人？  還是小孩？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.87,0:15:40.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然明知現實中的自己是十歲小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.71,0:15:42.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但內心卻在抗拒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.60,0:15:45.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然能想到很勁的下流段子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:48.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是卻只想將其藏於心中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:50.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成為大人真是不可思議啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.98,0:15:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天天在想這種事嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.00,0:15:58.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這一定是夢的程序的影響
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.81,0:16:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒來後就會恢復原樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.60,0:16:04.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在一切的想法和感覺  基本上都會忘記的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要  我不想忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.14,0:16:10.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准用大人的身體耍小孩子脾氣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:11.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該醒來了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:12.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.64,0:16:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為現在的我對皆本的喜歡要十倍於十歲的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:21.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  那個時候…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.98,0:16:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道嗎  皆本  我啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.77,0:16:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最喜歡你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:30.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愛你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.98,0:16:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我確實聽到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那句話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.83,0:16:42.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是為什麼至今…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.72,0:16:45.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然可能只是一場夢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.55,0:16:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是對現在的我來說\N皆本是從我十歲的時候就一直保護著我的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.57,0:16:53.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你討厭現在的我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.27,0:16:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對於皆本來說  我只是小時候的薰嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.54,0:16:59.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.90,0:17:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使在現實世界  我也會一直陪你到長大成人的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.62,0:17:08.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保證
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.41,0:17:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那皆本對我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.35,0:17:19.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個回答  我會在遇到真正的你的時候再說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.18,0:17:20.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.63,0:17:23.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你要向我保證
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:35.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.38,0:17:38.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說好了哦  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.31,0:17:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:51.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是人小鬼大  還和我討價還價
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.26,0:17:54.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過真是玩不過她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.79,0:17:56.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.41,0:17:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  你醒來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.38,0:18:00.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.65,0:18:04.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊  薰還在睡覺啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.23,0:18:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過黑卷的力量應該已經解開了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.24,0:18:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定馬上就會醒來的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.21,0:18:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  這裡是？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.22,0:18:15.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.18,0:18:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲  皆本  你醒過來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.59,0:18:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼連我也睡著了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊  原來你不記得了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.05,0:18:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全不記得
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.58,0:18:28.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  不是作為超能力者也不是作為普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.37,0:18:31.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果大家都能以人類的身份活下去的話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的未來一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.30,0:18:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太天真了  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.35,0:18:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實他可能也已經察覺到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:54.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些孩子結合在一起的話  自己也有可能會得救
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.31,0:19:06.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  不能在這種地方睡覺
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.06,0:19:07.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近都沒能好好睡覺
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.37,0:19:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了  我已經到極限了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.16,0:19:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.35,0:19:19.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她很有精神的  說是和朋友到處逛會兒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.63,0:19:20.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.75,0:19:27.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都很努力啊  謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:33.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  和傳言中的一樣  是超珍稀卡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.43,0:19:34.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  東野君
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.98,0:19:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東野  你偶爾也買點禮物送給千里嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.74,0:19:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨…你…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:42.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那這個平家蟹卡就送你了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.62,0:19:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  我不想要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.28,0:19:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.16,0:19:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是認識的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.82,0:19:50.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  你們先回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.02,0:19:57.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是有什麼危險的話  要拉響防範警鈴哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.74,0:19:59.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會有事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千里  明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.32,0:20:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心靈感應能力者啊  是女王你的同學嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.30,0:20:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說啊  能不要叫我女王嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.75,0:20:13.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你也不要叫我兵部先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我該怎麼叫你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該不會讓我叫你少佐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.33,0:20:20.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部京介
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.29,0:20:23.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  叫我京介就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.53,0:20:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切  太詐了  我都沒辦法發火了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.63,0:20:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開玩笑的  你就和以前一樣叫我兵部先生…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  京介
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.31,0:20:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你  幫我救出了皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用道謝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.51,0:20:42.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正救出他的人是你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.65,0:20:45.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會給你提示是因為我敵不過你的淚水
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.19,0:20:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完全不記得夢裡的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.03,0:20:49.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是怎樣的夢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.09,0:20:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在裡面做了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.21,0:20:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.26,0:20:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要聽他說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.70,0:20:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.10,0:20:58.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲  很有精神嘛  皆本君
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.88,0:21:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不要這樣啊  你們兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:05.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老實說  我以為你會更早放棄的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.14,0:21:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到你卻這麼難纏\N居然讓程序重複了我預想中的十倍以上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:13.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閉嘴  將雙手緊貼地面  立刻照做
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.40,0:21:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你不要得意忘形了  能改變未來的只有我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.78,0:21:22.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才要對你說  我一定會保護好薰給你看的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.02,0:21:31.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看在你這麼頑固的份上  女王就暫時放在你那裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.92,0:21:33.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總有一天我們會再見的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.30,0:21:34.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.84,0:21:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這Loli控  悶聲色狼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.86,0:21:42.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  這是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.48,0:21:45.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做了什麼夢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.07,0:21:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囉嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.00,0:21:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊  難道是不能告訴別人的夢嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:56.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要戲弄大人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.61,0:22:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有五年
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.03,0:22:04.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.18,0:22:07.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就讓你睡上五年好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.04,0:23:42.03,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道下集預告這東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下回的絕對可憐Children是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.27,0:23:45.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,電視機前的朋友們  謝謝你們一直為我們加油
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.15,0:23:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是常盤奈津子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.25,0:23:47.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是野分螢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.25,0:23:49.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下回是特別情節
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.91,0:23:54.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會將超能力者的情報\N還有關於B.A.B.E.L的各種事情一口氣大公開
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.06,0:23:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不能錯過的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.21,0:23:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.92,0:24:03.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特別情節  「盛宴！奈津子和螢的B.A.B.E.L通信」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.07,0:24:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要正座著看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.12,0:24:06.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們搶下預告了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.75,0:24:08.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐  所以不會輸！

